# Files stow must not link out of this package. This file replaces stow's
# built-in ignore list, so the defaults this repo needs are restated below;
# the RCS, CVS, Subversion, darcs, and Mercurial patterns are left out.
# Entries are anchored regexes; a leading ^/ anchors to the top of the package.

# --- stow's defaults, restated -------------------------------------------------
^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING
\.git
\.gitignore
\.gitmodules
.+~
\#.*\#

# --- this package's additions ---------------------------------------------------
# The extension lists are inputs to install.sh, not files that belong in $HOME.
^/extensions.*\.txt
# macOS creates .DS_Store in any directory Finder opens. Stow's defaults do not
# cover it, so without this line it would be linked into $HOME.
\.DS_Store
